        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಿಪತ್ತು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಪತ್ತು — vipattu — \"a disaster; a calamity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಆ ಜಿಲ್ಲೆಗೆ ದೊಡ್ಡ ವಿಪತ್ತು ತಂದಿತು. pravāha ā jillege doḍḍa vipattu tanditu. The flood brought a great disaster to that district."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ವಿಪತ್ತುಗಳು, vipattugaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರಕೃತಿ ವಿಕೋಪ is the news phrase for a natural disaster."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಪತ್ತು (vipattu) is borrowed from Sanskrit vipatti, \"misfortune, adversity, disaster\" (CDIAL 11788)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
