              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಿಲುಕು — siluku — \"to be caught; to be trapped\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪ್ರವಾಹದಲ್ಲಿ ನೂರು ಜನ ಸಿಲುಕಿದರು. pravāhadalli nūru jana silukidaru. A hundred people were trapped in the flood."
            },
