          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಿಲುಕು (siluku) is native Dravidian: DEDR 2498 lists Kannada siluku beside Tamil cikku, \"to be entangled, caught, ensnared\"."
            }
          ]
