              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂತ್ರಸ್ತ — santrasta — \"a victim; one affected\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂತ್ರಸ್ತರಿಗೆ ಊಟ ಮತ್ತು ಬಟ್ಟೆ ಕೊಟ್ಟರು. santrastarige ūṭa mattu baṭṭe koṭṭaru. They gave food and clothes to the victims."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಸಂತ್ರಸ್ತರು, santrastaru."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A news word for people hit by a flood, a fire or a quake: ಪ್ರವಾಹ ಸಂತ್ರಸ್ತರು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
