              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುನ್ಸೂಚನೆ — munsūcane — \"a forewarning; a forecast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹವಾಮಾನ ಇಲಾಖೆ ಮೂರು ದಿನದ ಮುಂಚೆ ಮುನ್ಸೂಚನೆ ಕೊಟ್ಟಿತ್ತು. havāmāna ilākhe mūru dinada muñce munsūcane koṭṭittu. The weather department had given a warning three days earlier."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುನ್, before, and ಸೂಚನೆ, a notice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
