          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮುನ್ಸೂಚನೆ (munsūcane) is a Kannada compound of native mun, \"before, in front\" (DEDR 5020), and ಸೂಚನೆ, from Sanskrit sūcanā, \"an indication, a communication\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
